eo Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\"\n        trackback:ping=\"/trackback/2608.06930\" />\n    </rdf:RDF>\n--><div id=\"abs-outer\">\n\n  <div class=\"leftcolumn\">\n    <div class=\"subheader\">\n      <h1>Computer Science > Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header-breadcrumbs-mobile\">\n      <strong>arXiv:2608.06930v1</strong> (cs)\n    </div>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/static/base/1.0.1/css/abs.css\">\n<div id=\"content-inner\">\n  <div id=\"abs\">\n    <div class=\"dateline\">\n  [Submitted on 7 Aug 2026]</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title mathjax\"><span class=\"descriptor\">Title:</span>AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward</h1>\n    <div class=\"authors\"><span class=\"descriptor\">Authors:</span><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wu,+M\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mingyang Wu</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Feng,+K\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaituo Feng</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li,+B\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bohao Li</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gong,+K\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaixiong Gong</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yin,+Z\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zihao Yin</a>, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/search/cs?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yue,+X\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xiangyu Yue</a></div>            <div id=\"download-button-info\" hidden>View a PDF of the paper titled AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward, by Mingyang Wu and 5 other authors</div>\n    <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"/pdf/2608.06930v1\">View PDF</a>\n    <a class=\"mobile-submission-download\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2608.06930v1\">HTML (experimental)</a>\n\n\n\n    <blockquote class=\"abstract mathjax\">\n            <span class=\"descriptor\">Abstract:</span>Detailed audio-video joint captioning is essential for multimodal video understanding and generation. However, prior works are constrained by three main limitations: (1) the scarcity of high-quality public datasets with fine-grained audio-visual joint captions; (2) reinforcement-learning methods that rely on coarse reward signals; and (3) the lack of a benchmark and metric for evaluating detailed audiovisual captions at the atomic level. To address these challenges, we propose: (1) AVCap-100K, a high-quality dataset of 100K temporally aligned, detail-rich audio-video captions; (2) AVCap, a model optimized via Detail-Aware GRPO (Da-GRPO) that achieves state-of-the-art performance among open-source models and matches or surpasses proprietary models on several evaluations; and (3) AVCap-Bench and AVCap-Score, a specialized benchmark and metric for evaluating atomic-level details in audiovisual captions. Our code, models, and datasets are available at <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/Apryle/avcap\" rel=\"external noopener nofollow\" class=\"link-external link-https\">this https URL</a>.\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <!--CONTEXT-->\n    <div class=\"metatable\">\n      <table summary=\"Additional metadata\"><tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Subjects:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell subjects\">\n            <span class=\"primary-subject\">Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (cs.CV)</span></td>\n        </tr><tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">Cite as:</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxivid\"><span class=\"arxivid\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06930\">arXiv:2608.06930</a> [cs.CV]</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&nbsp;</td>\n          <td class=\"tablecell arxividv\">(or <span class=\"arxivid\">\n              <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.06930v1\">arXiv:2608.06930v1</a> [cs.CV]</span> for this version)\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"tablecell label\">&