bution</span></a></li>\n239\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#A2.SS3\" title=\"In Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">B.3 </span>Validation Audits</span></a></li>\n240\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#A2.SS4\" title=\"In Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">B.4 </span>AVCap-Bench Annotation Protocol</span></a></li>\n241\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#A2.SS5\" title=\"In Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">B.5 </span>Human Evaluation</span></a></li>\n242\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\">\n243\t<a href=\"#A2.SS6\" title=\"In Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">B.6 </span>Data Curation Prompts</span></a>\n244\t<ol class=\"ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection\">\n245\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection\"><a href=\"#A2.SS6.SSS1\" title=\"In B.6 Data Curation Prompts ‣ Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap: Reinforcing Audio-Video Joint Caption with Detail-Aware Reward\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref\">B.6.1 </span>Visual Analysis Module</span></a></li>\n246\t<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection\"><a href=\"#A2.SS6.SSS2\" title=\"In B.6 Data Curation Prompts ‣ Appendix B AVCap-100K Dataset Details ‣ AVCap